      en: ["The highest point in Gabon, with an official elevation of ~1,575 m.", "Part of the Chaillu Massif, Gabon's central mountain range.", "The summit area experiences a cooler montane climate.", "Primarily composed of ancient Precambrian granite and gneiss.", "Home to rare plant species belonging to the Afro-montane zone.", "Crucial watershed area for several tributaries of the Ogooué River."],
